{"id":"665025","name":"鸡爪烧龙虾尾","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/665025/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"龙虾尾","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡爪去甲洗净。","img":"images/665025/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将鸡爪冷水下锅焯烫后洗净。","img":"images/665025/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片翻炒。","img":"images/665025/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入鸡爪炒匀。","img":"images/665025/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"适量蚝油，生抽，老抽翻炒均匀上色。","img":"images/665025/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/665025/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将鸡爪转入电高压锅。","img":"images/665025/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一个煮饭模式即可。","img":"images/665025/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"龙虾尾提前解冻。","img":"images/665025/step_9.png"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中水开放入龙虾尾焯烫过后捞出备用。","img":"images/665025/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"生姜切细备用。","img":"images/665025/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"焖好的鸡爪取出备用。","img":"images/665025/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中热油放入生姜炒香。","img":"images/665025/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入火锅底料炒香。","img":"images/665025/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入龙虾尾大火翻炒。","img":"images/665025/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入鸡爪和原汤。","img":"images/665025/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"加入少量清水。","img":"images/665025/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"大火煮开焖五分钟左右入味收汁即可。","img":"images/665025/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665025/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665025/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}